      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "This page sums **daily cache rows** for the time range in the picker. Each midnight caches the previous Asia/Singapore calendar day of `commands` in 6-hour chunks (so Influx never hits the 432-file limit), walking back until logs start. Opening or refreshing does **not** scan the raw command log.",
